  << /ActualText (A small arcade pad to play your favorite retro games\041 \050\050with 10 buttons total\072 6 main face buttons for your casual fighting\054 retro games \053 2 side buttons for pinball games\054 and we cant forget start\057select\041\050\050Using a esp32 super mini it shows up as a regular game controller to play on your pc\041 set it up via steam input or your chosen game emulator\056)
